    "title": "BlackRock Sells Over $22 Billion of These Two Cryptocurrencies So Far in November 2026",
    "summary": "The post BlackRock Sells Over $22 Billion of These Two Cryptocurrencies So Far in November 2026 appeared first on Coinpedia Fintech News\nBlackRock’s investors have sold cryptocurrencies worth more than $22 billion so far in November 2026, despite cumulative positive fundamentals. As of Friday, November 27, BlackRock had offloaded crypto assets worth approximately $22.36 billion, according to data Coinpedia fetched from Arkham Intelligence, a blockchain analytics platform.  Source: Arkham Intelligence  As a result, the firm’s crypto portfolio …",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://coinpedia.org/news/blackrock-sells-over-22-billion-of-these-two-cryptocurrencies-so-far-in-november-2026/",
